  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/BouJovesSantJoaquim.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;&uacute;ltim dia d&#39;exibicions taurines al barri de Sant Joaquim a Onda ha sigut bastant accidentat, ja que el bou dels Joves, de S&aacute;nchez Valverde, s&#39;ha ferit a la pota a la prova de la vesprada. El de &#39;corro&#39; que l&#39;ha substituit a l&#39;embolada s&#39;ha trencat la banya nom&eacute;s eixir al pil&oacute; i l&#39;han hagut de retirar.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/EmboladaSantJoaquimUltimDissabte.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>S&#39;ha provat i embolat amb normalitat l&#39;altre exemplar, el de la ramaderia de Manuel Caro.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4133.jpg\" alt=\"img_4133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4134.jpg\" alt=\"img_4134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4136.jpg\" alt=\"img_4136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4142.jpg\" alt=\"img_4142\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4145.jpg\" alt=\"img_4145\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4150.jpg\" alt=\"img_4150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdissabtesantjoaquin17/img_4152.jpg\" alt=\"img_415